L = 4 × π × 9² × (0.496 + 0.124) = 4 × 3.141592653589793 × 81 × 0.62 = 4 × 3.141592653589793 × 50.02 = 627.9238898039686 W.  

{"value": 627.9238898039686, "unit": "W"}

